<div class="page">
  <div style="text-align: center;">
    <h1 style="font-size: 18pt; margin-bottom: 5px;">THIAGARAJAR COLLEGE OF ENGINEERING, MADURAI</h1>
    <h2 style="font-size: 14pt; margin-top: 0;">Skill Development Program</h2>
    <h3 style="text-align: center; margin-top: 30px;">Approval Form</h3>
  </div>
  <div style="margin-top: 40px;">
    <p>To</p>
    <p>The Chairman / The Principal</p>
    <p>Thiagarajar College of Engineering,</p>
    <p>Madurai.</p>
    <p>Respected Sir,</p>
    <p>Sub: Skill Development Training on "<span data-field="training_topic_approval">{{ training_topic_approval }}</span>" – Approval – Reg.</p>
    <p style="margin-top: 30px;">Department of <span data-field="department_approval">{{ department_approval }}</span> Engineering is expertise in <span data-field="expertise_domain">{{ expertise_domain }}</span> domain and</p>
    <p>the department have facilities like, <span data-field="department_facilities">{{ department_facilities }}</span>.</p>
    <p>This/these instrument(s) may be used to train the Students / Workers / Engineers in <span data-field="training_area_approval">{{ training_area_approval }}</span>.</p>
    <p>The number of trainees <span data-field="trainee_per_batch">{{ trainee_per_batch }}</span> per batch and the fess per candidate is <span data-field="fee_per_candidate">{{ fee_per_candidate }}</span> (including Service Tax.)</p>
    <p>Course Coordinator : <span data-field="course_coordinator_approval">{{ course_coordinator_approval }}</span></p>
    <p>Course name : <span data-field="course_name_approval">{{ course_name_approval }}</span></p>
    <p>Amount collected : <span data-field="amount_collected">{{ amount_collected }}</span></p>
    <p>Expenditure Details : <span data-field="expenditure_details">{{ expenditure_details }}</span></p>
    <p style="margin-top: 50px;">We kindly request you to approve this training programme and this fees will be remitted in</p>
    <p>A/c.</p>
  </div>
  <div style="display: flex; justify-content: space-between; margin-top: 100px;">
    <p>Thanking You,</p>
    <p>Yours faithfully,</p>
    <p>Dean/III</p>
  </div>
</div>

