    <p>Sir/Madam,</p>
    <p>It is pleasure to inform you that you are selected to attend the Training Course on "<span data-field="course_name_selection">{{ course_name_selection }}</span>" from <span data-field="start_date_selection">{{ start_date_selection }}</span> to <span data-field="end_date_selection">{{ end_date_selection }}</span> at <span data-field="location_selection">{{ location_selection }}</span> Seminar</p>
